<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman lowers Blue Circle.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman lowers Blue Circle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Building materials group Blue Circle Plc was cut to &quot;market underperformer&quot; from &quot;market performer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, a research note from the investment bank said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>In a review of the European building materials industry, the brokerage also cut Caradon Plc  CRN.L and Taylor Woodrow Plc to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market outperformer.&quot;</p>
<p>However Tarmac was raised to Goldman's European recommended list from a previous &quot;market outperformer&quot; rating.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
